    "body": "I am using [Conversations ](www.conversations.im)(1.11.5) and chatting with two different partners, both using current version of Monal, all via jabber.de.\n- If I receive an Image, Conversations displays the received image without problems as **in-line**, doesn't matter if it comes from partner1 oder partner2\n- If I send an image to partner**1**, the image is displayed **in-line** in Monal, as it should be.\n- If I send an image to partner**2**, the image is just displayed **as a link** to the jabber.de server to click it in Monal.\n\nWhat is going on here? Obviously it CAN work, but why does'nt make it in both cases, using the nearly same conditions? Is there any hidden preference?\n",
